## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0625, std = 0.1437, ICIR = 0.44, HAC t-stat = 7.2 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0781, std = 0.1420, IR = 0.55, HAC t-stat = 9.3 (lags=5)
